"Maricel Alcantara is a fifteen-year-old S-rank Shaper of Ground from the Philippines."
"She has very dark brown eyes and wears a black hoodie."
"She cut off her long pigtails after someone dragged her by her ponytail."
"She wants to be a hero only as a way home to her family in Manila."
"Otherwise she means to train until she can lift the seabed and build a bridge home."
"At the CNH assessment she befriended Alden Thorn by giving him a clod with a yellow weed."
"She was accepted into the CNH hero track as a Quarter 1 student."
